From: IGRF maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Respect staged installs when compiling schemas

Wheel building performs an install into a staging root; defer schema
compilation to Buildroot host-libglib2 finalization instead.

Upstream: Not submitted

--- a/setup.py
+++ b/setup.py
@@ -440,7 +440,7 @@
         install.run(self)
 
         # Only run this if NOT inside a fakeroot environment
-        if not os.getenv("FAKEROOTKEY"):
+        if not self.root and not os.getenv("FAKEROOTKEY"):
             print("Running tools/gen_gschema.py...")
             
 
